    sampleAnswer: "Digital marketing is the use of digital channels, platforms,\ndata, and technology to attract, engage, convert, and retain customers.\nCommon channels include search engines, paid advertising, social media,\nemail, content, websites, and other digital touchpoints.\n\nA good digital marketing program connects channel activity to a business\nobjective. Instead of optimizing only clicks or impressions, a marketer\nshould understand the customer journey, define measurable goals, track\nconversions, and evaluate business outcomes such as revenue, qualified\nleads, customer acquisition cost, or retention.",
