    sampleAnswer: "Bounce rate is a web-analytics metric related to visits or\nsessions where the user leaves without triggering the relevant\nengagement criteria. Its exact definition depends on the analytics\nplatform and configuration.\n\nA high bounce rate is not automatically bad. A page can satisfy a user’s\nintent in one visit. It should therefore be interpreted with\nlanding-page purpose, engagement, conversion rate, traffic source,\ndevice, and other behavioral signals.",
